<p><a name="fn5"></a>5. See California Department of Insurance (2018), "<a href="http://www.insurance.ca.gov/0400-news/0100-press-releases/2018/release002-18.cfm">Insurance Commissioner Dave Jones Releases Report Addressing Fire Insurance Availability Issues</a>," press release, January 4; and California Department of Insurance (2021), "<a href="http://www.insurance.ca.gov/0400-news/0100-press-releases/2021/release078-2021.cfm">Wildfire Survivors Now Covered by New Insurance Protections</a>," press release, July 27. <a href="#f5">Return to text</a></p>

