<p><a name="fn13"></a>13. See Robert Vermeulen, Edo Schets, Melanie Lohuis, Barbara K&ouml;lbl, David-Jan Jansen, and Willem Heeringa (2018), "An Energy Transition Risk Stress Test for the Financial System of the Netherlands," Occasional Studies, vol. 16-7 (Amsterdam: De Nederlandsche Bank, October), available at <a href="https://www.dnb.nl/en/publications/research-publications/occasional-studies/nr-7-2018-an-energy-transition-risk-stress-test-for-the-financial-system-of-the-netherlands/">https://www.dnb.nl/en/publications/research-publications/occasional-studies/nr-7-2018-an-energy-transition-risk-stress-test-for-the-financial-system-of-the-netherlands</a>. <a href="#f13">Return to text</a></p>

